0..76 Comment "// A theory whose operation lands at a sort indexed by two calls, the second"
77..156 Comment "// call\'s sort indexed by the first. Another theory includes it, and a function"
157..195 Comment "// takes and gives back a model of it."
196..198 Comment "//"
199..277 Comment "// The model type of such a theory states the operation as a function into the"
278..352 Comment "// family at those two calls. The include and the function form that type."
353..355 Comment "//"
356..434 Comment "// Each index that applies an operation stands in its family call as the value"
435..510 Comment "// that the call returns. The later index then reads the same value, so the"
511..533 Comment "// family call checks."
534..536 Comment "//"
537..552 Comment "// - see: #5051"
